oside B, Rossicaside A, Verbascoside, Isoverbascoside, Forsythoside A, Globularin (10-O-trans-Cinnamoylcatalpol), Leucosceptoside A, 6&#x02032; -O-Feruloyl-10 -O-hydroxytyrosol glucoside, Globularioside, Globusintenoside isomer, 6&#x02032; -O-Caffeoylverbascoside, Apigenin, Globuloside A, Galypumoside B</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">[<xref rid="B125-plants-14-03641" ref-type="bibr">125</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
